-- Demo sets were generated before the generator learned to keep to the
-- subject: their questions and explanations said «согласно фрагменту», «в
-- тексте сказано, что…». Rewritten by hand; an explanation with nothing but
-- that is left empty, and the feed hides an empty one.

-- Every statement touches a seed row by its id, and only while its text is
-- still the seed's: a user's own card with the same text is left alone.
-- +goose Up
-- +goose StatementBegin
